# Benchmark harness output. The JSONL/CSV summaries ARE worth keeping -- they are
# the artifact. The per-run netcdf and zarr checkpoints are regenerable bulk
# (Stage 3 writes ~50 of them) and would otherwise land in git, since Results/ is
# otherwise fully tracked.
Results/Benchmarks/runs/**/*.nc
Results/Benchmarks/runs/**/checkpoint/
